      "sourceText": "代码中row变量的含义是某个数据所在元素的行数，col变量的含义是某个数据所在元素的列数，channel变量的含义是某个数据所在元素的通道数。这种方式与我们通过指针读取数据的形式类似，都是通过将首个数据的地址指针移动若干位后指向需要读取的数据，只不过这种方式可以通过直接给出行、列和通道数进行读取，不需要用户再计算某个数据在这行数据存储空间中的位置。",
      "translatedText": "In the code, the row variable means the row number of the element where a certain data item is located, the col variable means the column number of the element where a certain data item is located, and the channel variable means the channel number of the element where a certain data item is located\\. This approach is similar to the way we read data through pointers, in that both point to the data to be read by moving the address pointer of the first data item by a certain number of positions; however, this approach can perform reading by directly specifying the row, column, and channel numbers, and does not require the user to calculate the position of a certain data item within the storage space of this row of data\\.",
